{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Day night cycle strategy game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build during the day, fight at night - defend your territory with your mind and swords!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udff0\u3010Building strategy\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the day, players need to construct and upgrade buildings, allocate resources to develop the economy, and deploy soldiers to establish defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/4\u670822\u65e5_6_.gif?t=1746209941\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f\u3010Battle Control\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, players need to control the lords and command the soldiers to participate in the battle and defend against the tidal wave of enemies. The Lords are not only the decision makers of the buildings, but they can also use different weapons to participate in the battle directly and change the battle situation through skills such as slowing down and group attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/\u6218\u6597.gif?t=1746209941\" />   <strong> </strong>  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae\u3010Skill strategy\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Unlock new skills through the out-of-game system, match Rogue words, tweak and test your new builds, and challenge yourself to higher difficulties.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive the tidal wave of enemies and powerful bosses?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648260?t=1746209941","background_raw":"https://store.a